# Check out text files with LF everywhere: files are embedded into the app
# and shipped into the Linux VM, and tests parse YAML with line-anchored
# regexps.
* text=auto eol=lf
# minio/entrypoint.sh and scripts/backup.sh run inside Linux containers — keep
# them LF so a Windows checkout can't introduce CRLF that the container shell trips on.
*.sh text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
